    <h2>NetBSD BoF 2026</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt> Date and time
      <dd>2025/07/5 (Sun) 14:00 - 18:00

      <dt>Agenda
      <dd>
	<p>
The Birds of a Feather: The casual meeting for individuals who have interests to the NetBSD.
Both just join the meeting to hear the topics and Presenting some topics are welcome.
	<p><b>
This BoF is open to everybody regardless of the memebers of <a href="/ja/JP/JNUG/">JNUG</a> or NOT.
</b></p>
      <dt name="Zoom">Zoom
      <dd>You can join the BoF via <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/w0cjr2WWTtij8d1Yl9K9xg">this link</a>.

